'' 'U( 3 )' WHERE A VARIABLE SHARES THE NAME OF A TYPE WITH NO CONSTRUCTOR -- 'dim u as U'.
'' The name binds to the variable, which is no array, and the type has nothing to call, so
'' it is TKO0917 (fbc's error 72). Lowering stopped with TKO0994 before. An array of the
'' type's name is subscripted and is fine.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/udt-call-same-name.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' GOLDEN: expected/udt-call-same-name.out
